{
  "description": "One representative county per state, DC and each territory in the Census county file, with the crash source, CEQA screen and state grant bundle OpenPlan should select for it.",
  "source": {
    "name": "U.S. Census Bureau, 2024 Cartographic Boundary File, Counties, 1:500,000 (cb_2024_us_county_500k)",
